                  "value" : "On this day %lld years ago"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only the photos you selected for Nextcloud Photos are backed up." : {
      "comment" : "Added to the result of a backup run when the user gave the app access to selected photos only (limited Photos access). \"Nextcloud Photos\" is the app's name."
    },
    "Only your own photos can be added to an album." : {
      "comment" : "Error when saving a memory as an album: none of its photos is the user's own (all are in shared folders)."
    },
    "Only your own photos can be shared by link." : {
      "comment" : "Error message when the user tries to create a share link for photos that someone else shared with them."
    },
    "Person" : {
      "comment" : "Spotlight: kind of a result that is a person."
    },
    "Photo of the Day" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the daily photo notification."
    },
    "Place" : {
      "comment" : "Spotlight: kind of a result that is a place."
    },
    "Postcard" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the public link of a sent postcard."
    },
    "Postcard to %@" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the public link of a sent postcard; the argument is the name the card is addressed to."
    },
    "Ratings and flags need the Collaborative tags app on your server." : {
      "comment" : "Culling error: the server has no system tags."
    },
    "Remove from Album" : {
      "comment" : "Name of an action in Edit › Undo / Redo (shown as \"Undo Remove from Album\"): photos were removed from an album. Title-style capitalisation as in the menu bar."
    },
    "Remove from Favorites" : {
      "comment" : "Name of an action in Edit › Undo / Redo (shown as \"Undo Remove from Favorites\"): photos are no longer favourites. Title-style capitalisation as in the menu bar."
    },
    "Revert to Original" : {
      "comment" : "Edit › Undo Revert to Original: the undo action's name for removing a photo's edits."
    },
    "Rotate" : {
      "comment" : "Edit › Undo Rotate: the undo action's name for Image › Rotate."
    },
    "Shared items were not uploaded" : {
      "comment" : "Title of a notification: items the user shared to Nextcloud Photos from another app could not be uploaded after the share sheet was closed."
    },
    "Shared on %@" : {
      "comment" : "Name of the album that is created when the user shares photos with a link. %@ is today's date, e.g. \"Shared on 23 Nov 2026\"."
    },
    "Shared with you without permission to change it." : {
      "comment" : "Batch fixes: why a photo was not changed."
    },
    "The desktop pictures change while the account they come from is shown in Nextcloud Photos." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Desktop Picture: the rotation waits because another account is active."
    },
    "The photo could not be loaded from your Nextcloud." : {
      "comment" : "Use as Desktop Picture: the photo could not be downloaded."
    },
    "There are no photos to show. Open the album once, so that its photos are on this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Settings › Desktop Picture: the rotation's album or source has no photos (yet)."
    },
    "This person is no longer there." : {
      "comment" : "People on this device: a person that was merged or removed meanwhile."
    },
    "This server can't change the date or place of this kind of file. Nextcloud 35 or later can." : {
      "comment" : "Batch fixes: why a video or other file was skipped on servers older than Nextcloud 35."
    },
    "This week %lld years ago" : {
      "comment" : "Daily photo notification: the photo was taken around this day N years ago. Plural variations in the catalog.",
